  "solution": {
    "text": "<img width=\"250px\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/pvqw1grk57RGELsKmNPvXCPgV1vAIXqgXvpWnq9zX2Q.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>\n\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & I=\\frac{6}{(1+2) \\times 10^3}=2 \\times 10^{-3} \\\\ & V=I R=2 \\times 10^{-3} \\times 2 \\times 10^3=4 V \\\\ & q_1=1 \\times 4=4 \\mu C, q_2=2 \\times 4=8 \\mu C\\end{aligned}$",
